{"3848460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "星宇战舰 Astral-Battlecraft", "steam_appid": 3848460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Warships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Star Age, led by five major alliances — Vermilion Bird Alliance, Royal Reconnaissance Corps, Blue Star, Hawk-Eye Alliance, and Northern Shield — humanity has begun to explore the unknown universe. During this exploration, players will encounter diverse civilizations and planets, and need to control their warships to fight against these unknown civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras/5789f958de4fa6507eff6585450b4ba1.poster.avif?t=1785029917\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras/5789f958de4fa6507eff6585450b4ba1.webm?t=1785029917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras/5789f958de4fa6507eff6585450b4ba1.mp4?t=1785029917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Vampire-like roguelike game, Stellar Warships offers a variety of warship characters for players to choose from. Each warship has its unique weapon system and tactical features. Defeat a certain number of minor enemies, collect experience orbs, and obtain booster cards to enhance the warship's strength. After each game round, players will gain Exploration Points to unlock the skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras/afb6d4077842d7d3eee2a8a5e843afd1.poster.avif?t=1785029917\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras/afb6d4077842d7d3eee2a8a5e843afd1.webm?t=1785029917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras/afb6d4077842d7d3eee2a8a5e843afd1.mp4?t=1785029917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available characters include: Firefly, Voyager, Zealot, Omen, Tan Zehao, Scout, Kaerfa, and Pegasus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes we may fail, but we will grow stronger with every next attempt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: .gg/qwuhvgrXtC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide for New Players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the game, use the joystick at the bottom left to move, and the attack button at the bottom right to attack. Defeat minor enemies, collect experience orbs, and upgrade your warship's strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras/61f3aebd93442ffa3b2f9f8d4c4fcd73.avif?t=1785029917\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848460/extras_big/61f3aebd93442ffa3b2f9f8d4c4fcd73.avif?t=1785029917 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Rogue Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Battleship Rogue Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >light Tactical System, Inertia System, Drift System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIY Weapons: Flexible weapon customization with independent cooldowns. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Warships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Star Age, led by five major alliances — Vermilion Bird Alliance, Royal Reconnaissance Corps, Blue Star, Hawk-Eye Alliance, and Northern Shield — humanity has begun to explore the unknown unive